sequenceDiagram
    participant D as Draft model
    participant T as Target model
    loop one speculative round
        D->>D: propose K tokens from the accepted prefix
        D->>T: send the K drafted tokens
        T->>T: score all K positions in one forward pass
        alt every drafted token passes
            T-->>D: accept all K, then add one bonus token
        else first rejection at position i
            T-->>D: accept i tokens, resample from max(0, p - q)
        end
    end
